    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6adc0b78555612.47146703\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has posted hotfixes for today, which includes fixes for two high-profile Mythic+ bugs. <br><br><div class=\"markup-grid exclude-units\" data-align=\"centered\" style=\"--markup-gridColumnBasis: 275px;\"><div class=\"box-highlight exclude-units\" id=\"for-mythic\"><div class=\"box-highlight-heading\"><span class=\"box-highlight-title\">For Mythic+</span></div><div class=\"box-highlight-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1282115.jpg\" id=\"1282115\"><img width=\"300\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1282115.jpg?maxWidth=300\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"raiders image\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.77765 / 1;\"></a><div class=\"pad exclude-units\"></div><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The bug that caused Nalorakk's Echoing Roar to appear in the wrong location has been fixed.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The bug that caused Nibbles' Fel Spray to hit the wrong direction has been fixe.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The high-profile bug of Warlocks ninja pulling when a rogue is in a group has been fixed</div></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"box-highlight exclude-units\" data-accent=\"c8\" id=\"for-everyday-players\"><div class=\"box-highlight-heading\"><span class=\"box-highlight-title\">For Everyday Players</span></div><div class=\"box-highlight-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1282114.jpg\" id=\"1282114\"><img width=\"300\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1282114.jpg?maxWidth=300\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"everyday players\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.77765 / 1;\"></a><div class=\"pad exclude-units\"></div><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Ascendant Venomstone item level has been fixed.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Another Labyrinth bug has been fixed.</div></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2382684/127\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>October 23, 2026</b><br><br><b>Classes</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Shaman</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Enhancement</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Resolved an issue causing Surging Elements to not appear on the Cooldown Manager.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Warlock</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed issues that caused some warlock summons and Diabolic Occuli to sometimes incorrectly target enemies outside of combat. This corrects summons from Affliction’s Shadows of Nath’reza, Demonology’s Dominion of Argus, as well as Diabolist summons.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul><b>Dungeons</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Den of Nalorakk</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Addressed an issue where Nalorakk’s Echoing Maul can sometimes happen in the wrong location.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Murder Row</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Addressed an issue where Nibbles’ Fel Spray can hit targets outside of the intended area.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul><b>Hallow’s End</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Neighborhoods</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Players can now exit combat with the Shade of Seabreaker Skoloth.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul><b>Items</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed an issue that caused items upgraded with Ascendant Venomstones to have incorrect item levels.</div></li></ul><b>Labyrinth</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Shorter character models will no longer fall through floor when respawning in Jan’alai’s Refuge.</div></li></ul></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has posted hotfixes for today, which includes fixes for two high-profile Mythic+ bugs. <br /><br /><ul><li>The bug that caused Nalorakk's Echoing Roar to appear in the wrong location has been fixed.</li><li>The bug that caused Nibbles' Fel Spray to hit the wrong direction has been fixe.</li><li>The high-profile bug of Warlocks ninja pulling when a rogue is in a group has been fixed</li></ul><br /><br /><ul><li>Ascendant Venomstone item level has been fixed.</li><li>Another Labyrinth bug has been fixed.</li></ul><br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\"><b>October 23, 2026</b><br /><br /><b>Classes</b><br /><br /><ul><li><b>Shaman</b><br /><br /> <b>Enhancement</b><br /><br /> Resolved an issue causing Surging Elements to not appear on the Cooldown Manager.</li></ul><br /><br /> <b>Warlock</b><br /> <ul><li>Fixed issues that caused some warlock summons and Diabolic Occuli to sometimes incorrectly target enemies outside of combat. This corrects summons from Affliction’s Shadows of Nath’reza, Demonology’s Dominion of Argus, as well as Diabolist summons.</li></ul><br /><br /><b>Dungeons</b><br /><br /><ul><li><b>Den of Nalorakk</b><br /><br /> Addressed an issue where Nalorakk’s Echoing Maul can sometimes happen in the wrong location.</li></ul><br /> <b>Murder Row</b><br /> <ul><li>Addressed an issue where Nibbles’ Fel Spray can hit targets outside of the intended area.</li></ul><br /><br /><b>Hallow’s End</b><br /><br /><ul><li><b>Neighborhoods</b><br /><br /> Players can now exit combat with the Shade of Seabreaker Skoloth.</li></ul><br /><br /><b>Items</b><br /><br /><ul><li>Fixed an issue that caused items upgraded with Ascendant Venomstones to have incorrect item levels.</li></ul><br /><b>Labyrinth</b><br /><br /><ul><li>Shorter character models will no longer fall through floor when respawning in Jan’alai’s Refuge.</li></ul></div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
