    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6adc0b7821f2f9.93056601\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Players can now see various stats about their WoW: Forever Beta experience and share their results with their friends!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://timewalking.blizzard.com/\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">See Your Stats Here</span></a></div><br><br>The WoW: Forever Beta ends at 10:00 AM PDT today and Blizzard has released a new Timewalkling feature, which shows you awesome stats about your adventures in the WoW: Forever Beta. This feature can show you how many hours you played, to the mob that killed you the most, to the number of times you've jumped!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1306464.jpg\" id=\"1306464\"><img width=\"400\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1306464.jpg?maxWidth=400\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"WoW Forever Timewalking Stats\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 0.5625 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>There are lots of stats here, so hop in and check them out. At the bottom of the page, you can find a customizable stats tool, where you can mix and match your favorite personal stats to create a custom image and then share it with friends!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1306465.png\" id=\"1306465\"><img width=\"400\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1306465.png?maxWidth=400\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Customizable Image Builder\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.17167 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Players can now see various stats about their WoW: Forever Beta experience and share their results with their friends!<br /><br />See Your Stats Here<br /><br />The WoW: Forever Beta ends at 10:00 AM PDT today and Blizzard has released a new Timewalkling feature, which shows you awesome stats about your adventures in the WoW: Forever Beta. This feature can show you how many hours you played, to the mob that killed you the most, to the number of times you've jumped!<br /><br />There are lots of stats here, so hop in and check them out. At the bottom of the page, you can find a customizable stats tool, where you can mix and match your favorite personal stats to create a custom image and then share it with friends!<br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
